            "»": "→"
          },
          "note": "CDU line 1, pilot seat. The CH-47F CDU is 14 lines of 24, the MCDU's own grid, so line n sits on row n. Each line has a twin, PLT_CDU_LINEn_COLOR, one letter per character; colours.codes says what the letters mean. A space there leaves the field's own colour, white."
        },
