            "?": "%",
            "®": "Δ",
            "{": "↑",
            "¡": "☐",
            "»": "→",
            "«": "←"
          },
          "note": "Even lines 2 to 12 are the CDU's small labels, so they draw in the small font; line 14, the scratchpad, is large. Split taken from WCtrlDcsBiosBridge's CH-47F listener."
        },
