          "note": "DCS-BIOS sends the CDU's symbols as single bytes above ASCII (CH-47F.lua, cdu_replace_map), and the braces as arrows. replace turns each into the character whose glyph the CH-47F font draws for it: the arrows, the check mark (box slot), the up-down arrow (Delta slot), and ? in the % slot."
